angnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 beneath her breast, she fell upon the blade,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 still steaming from the blood of Pyramus. }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 But her entreaty did affect the gods}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 and moved her parents. So when fully ripe, }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \tab }{\fs16 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 240}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 the fruit is dark, and what remains of them}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 after the funeral pyre sits in one urn.\uc1 \u8221 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \nooverflow \faroman \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx6667 \tql \tx7387 \itap0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \af5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfen