24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033  When Perseus,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 grandson of Abas, saw the girl, whose arms}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 were chained to solid rock, he would have thought}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 she was a marble statue, but her hair}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 moved in the gentle breezes}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 ,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033  and warm tears }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \tab }{\fs16 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 1000}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 flowed from her eyes. Before he realized it,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1