\pard \plain \li216 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \nooverflow \faroman \lin216 \rin0 \tql \tx6667 \tql \tx7387 \itap0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \af5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033                             \uc1 \u8220 ?Brother, what are you doing?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 What foolishness has made you so enraged}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 and driven you to this illegal act?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 Is this the gratitude a person shows}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 for such great service? Is this your reward}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 for the one who saved her life? If you want}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 to know the truth, it was not Perseus}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp10