1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 he is my father-in-law.}{\cs17 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \af0 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \s46 \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa80 \widctlpar \nooverflow \faroman \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \af5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 {\cs17 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \super1 \chftn }{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 Jupiter is the father of Niobe\uc1 \u8217 ?s husband, Amphion. }}}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033  In Phrygia}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 people fear me. I rule the royal house}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 of Cadmus. My husband\uc1 \u8217 ?s power and mine}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 govern the people and the walls of Thebes, }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 built by the music of my husband\uc1 \u8217 ?s lyre.}{\cs17 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \af0 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \s46 \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa80 \widctlpar \nooverflow \faroman \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \h